  "semantics": [
    "Index Q consumes normalized main-query latent, performs actual FP8 cast/FP8-weight projection to BF16, trailing-64 interleaved RoPE then group-32 FP4",
    "Index Q has no separate learned head norm",
    "Head weights are signed BF16 current-hidden projection, without additional inferred scale",
    "Index K consumes main-compressor post-norm/pre-RoPE latent and applies its own BF16 projection/learned norm, explicit positions_c RoPE and FP4 cast",
    "Index Q/K and main-compressor call sites omit HadamardArgs, whose default is None; the function name is not evidence of an enabled transform",
    "C1 BF16 projection; C2 BF16 parameters and FP32 score/latent projection followed by per-channel pair compression to BF16",
    "Main-compressor learned norm precedes tail RoPE and explicit main-KV format; separate pre-RoPE view feeds index K"
  ],
